{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":10,"ref":"2-chronicles 26:10","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"de","chapter":26,"translation":"Und er baute Türme in der Wüste und hieb viele Zisternen aus, denn ⟨er⟩ hatte viel Vieh, und in der Schefela und in der Ebene ⟨hatte er⟩ Ackerbauern und Winzer, in den Bergen und im Karmel, denn ein Liebhaber des Ackerbodens war er.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויבן","gloss":"und ⟨er⟩ baute"},{"surface":"מגדלים","gloss":"Türme"},{"surface":"במדבר","gloss":"in der Wüste"},{"surface":"ויחצב","gloss":"und hieb aus"},{"surface":"ברות","gloss":"Zisternen"},{"surface":"רבים","gloss":"viele"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"denn"},{"surface":"מקנה","gloss":"Vieh"},{"surface":"רב","gloss":"viel"},{"surface":"היה","gloss":"war"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"ihm"},{"surface":"ובשפלה","gloss":"und in der Schefela"},{"surface":"ובמישור","gloss":"und in der Ebene"},{"surface":"אכרים","gloss":"Ackerbauern"},{"surface":"וכרמים","gloss":"und Winzer"},{"surface":"בהרים","gloss":"in den Bergen"},{"surface":"ובכרמל","gloss":"und im Karmel"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"denn"},{"surface":"אהב","gloss":"ein Liebhaber"},{"surface":"אדמה","gloss":"des Ackerbodens"},{"surface":"היה","gloss":"war er"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T00:00:01.679658130Z","model":"glm-5.2"}